text In the middle of class...
text @[Tomoya]
text (...What's that...?)
text I look outside the window as everything the teacher says goes in one ear and out the other.
text As classes have started, there is nobody around the school gate.
text There's something near the gate I don't recognize... What is it...?
text Since it's moving, it's likely an animal, but I can't say for sure what it is.
text It's too big to be a cat...
text Yet too round to be a dog...
text A raccoon? Well, its tail is too short for that.
text @[Tomoya]
text (...The pattern on its body is rather unique...)
text It looks kind of like vertical stripes.
text In any case, the animal-like thing is happily rubbing ─ is that its face? ─ against the wall next to the gate.
text The way that it's taking small but quick steps is rather cute.
